meta {
  name: POST set battery care-mode
  type: http
  seq: 36
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/charging/{{vin}}/set-care-mode
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "chargingCareMode": true
  }
}

docs {
  Toggle battery care-mode (caps charging ~80% to preserve the pack).
  Grounded in the myŠkoda mysmob ChargingCareModeDto (chargingCareMode
  bool). Implementation: SkodaClient.command_set_battery_care_mode() in
  cariad/api/skoda.py. Bearer-only, no S-PIN. Live-gated (client-surface
  groundwork; entity wiring follows a Škoda-owner confirmation).
}
